     "page": 44,
     "text": "GPU: Optimize Throughput of a Large Number of Simple Threads\n   Issue of SIMD Utilization: Control Divergence\n\n\n\n¡ A GPU uses a SIMD pipeline to save area on\n   control logic\n\n   ¡  Groups scalar threads into warps\n\n\n¡  Branch Divergence\n\n   ¡  Occurs when threads inside warps branch to\n       different execution path\n\n\n¡  Result: Only a subset of threads execute,\n   waste SIMD pipeline utilization",
